      "text": "Google docs -- design collaborative document editor\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36.432184518279286,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Google docs -- design collaborative document editor\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mpwVAXxIJfqsvGvihCy7I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 144.12819094810425,
      "y": 288.4536565942574,
      "width": 637.1395874023438,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2144939762,
      "version": 504,
      "versionNonce": 2144005590,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781728146469,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**** Requirements\nFunctional:\n-- Any participant can edit/view document\n-- Update by peers on same document are reflected automatically\n-- All participants should see same document revision\n-- Offline usage? \nNon-functional\n-- Update by others should be reflected real time\n-- Concurrent support up to 100 editors\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**** Requirements\nFunctional:\n-- Any participant can edit/view document\n-- Update by peers on same document are reflected automatically\n-- All participants should see same document revision\n-- Offline usage? \nNon-functional\n-- Update by others should be reflected real time\n-- Concurrent support up to 100 editors\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UhMDj44Fm5iEeuU3CY-pk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 905.834535238685,
      "y": 295.41137238419685,
      "width": 733.8394775390625,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 476385838,
      "version": 686,
      "versionNonce": 183353494,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781728148140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Background (gotcha!)\n-- Responsiveness (action reflected instantly)\n-- Real time updates\n-- Conflict-prone (edit/delete same parts)\n-- Distributed (access web application with no geographic constraint)\n-- Ad-hoc: can drop and join any time\n-- Unpredictable: not possible to predict order or information \n-- Access on browser tab level (access same document in 2 separated tab),\nno communication between browser tab",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Background (gotcha!)\n-- Responsiveness (action reflected instantly)\n-- Real time updates\n-- Conflict-prone (edit/delete same parts)\n-- Distributed (access web application with no geographic constraint)\n-- Ad-hoc: can drop and join any time\n-- Unpredictable: not possible to predict order or information \n-- Access on browser tab level (access same document in 2 separated tab),\nno communication between browser tab",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RmhkTBerm870_PxboXW0f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 132.1343968766057,
      "y": 538.2252208861782,
      "width": 1365.43896484375,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1866805614,
      "version": 1727,
      "versionNonce": 1077138134,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781731102892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**** Summary: -- include 4 different problems need to solve at once\n1) Make concurrent edits converge through central server and revision log\n-- client do not synchronize peer to peer\n-- Central server own document, client keep local replica for optimistic edit\n(typing never gated by network)\n-- conflict edit resolved with Operational transformation (append-only revision log),\neach edit is a revision version\n2) Treat offline reconnection as longer local update buffer\n-- Disconnect client keeps appending to local buffer\n-- Reconnect SYNC message send the last-seen version to server\n3) Keep undo personal by appending inverse operation\n-- Undo does not rewind the document to earlier state.\n-- Client appends the negation of user own most recent non-undo operation as new operation (local undo)\n-- User undo history stays local \n4) Reliability at application, not trusting Websockets\n-- each client keeps at most one update in-flight, tag with requestID for duplication\n-- wait for ACK before sending next\n-- Reordering, duplicates, brief disconnect are absorbed by revision numbers and requestIDs rather than websockect\n5) Document format at export boundary\n-- internal tree model is free to evolve independently without file format constraint (translate data to XML format for specific formatting)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**** Summary: -- include 4 different problems need to solve at once\n1) Make concurrent edits converge through central server and revision log\n-- client do not synchronize peer to peer\n-- Central server own document, client keep local replica for optimistic edit\n(typing never gated by network)\n-- conflict edit resolved with Operational transformation (append-only revision log),\neach edit is a revision version\n2) Treat offline reconnection as longer local update buffer\n-- Disconnect client keeps appending to local buffer\n-- Reconnect SYNC message send the last-seen version to server\n3) Keep undo personal by appending inverse operation\n-- Undo does not rewind the document to earlier state.\n-- Client appends the negation of user own most recent non-undo operation as new operation (local undo)\n-- User undo history stays local \n4) Reliability at application, not trusting Websockets\n-- each client keeps at most one update in-flight, tag with requestID for duplication\n-- wait for ACK before sending next\n-- Reordering, duplicates, brief disconnect are absorbed by revision numbers and requestIDs rather than websockect\n5) Document format at export boundary\n-- internal tree model is free to evolve independently without file format constraint (translate data to XML format for specific formatting)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wQk202x7QoFYjiSIKfeJw",
